      ],
      "text": "Role in ascariasis:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " tx all intestinal infections: albendazole, mebendazole or ivermectin; pregnancy: pyrantel pamoate; benzimidazoles are potentially teratogenic: in pregnancy, weigh tx risk vs untreated dz."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
